<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>New Student Assignment</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2563eb;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .assignment-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .assignment-type {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .assignment-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .student-count {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .info-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .info-card {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #7c3aed;
        }
        .info-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #1f2937;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .info-card p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .student-list {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .student-list h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #1f2937;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .student-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
        }
        .student-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .student-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .student-avatar {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }
        .student-details {
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .student-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .student-email {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }
        .student-status {
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .status-enrolled {
            background-color: #dcfce7;
            color: #166534;
        }
        .status-pending {
            background-color: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
        }
        .action-buttons {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .primary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 36px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
        }
        .secondary-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
        }
        .important-note {
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
            text-align: center;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .info-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .student-item {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                padding: 15px 0;
            }
            .student-status {
                margin-top: 10px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🚀 {{companyName}}</div>
            <h1 class="title">👨‍🏫 New Assignment</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{instructorName}},</p>

            <p>You have been assigned to mentor new students in their learning journey. Below are the details of your assignment.</p>

            <div class="assignment-banner">
                <div class="assignment-type">{{assignmentType}}</div>
                <div class="assignment-title">{{labName}}</div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-grid">
                {{#if duration}}
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>⏱️ Duration</h3>
                    <p>{{duration}}</p>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if labType}}
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>🎯 Lab Type</h3>
                    <p>{{labType}}</p>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <div class="action-buttons">
                <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="primary-button">📊 View Instructor Dashboard</a>
                {{#if labAccessUrl}}
                <a href="{{labAccessUrl}}" class="secondary-button">🚀 Access Lab Environment</a>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            {{#if responsibilities}}
            <div style="background-color: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #0ea5e9; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #0c4a6e;">📋 Your Responsibilities</h3>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #0c4a6e;">
                    {{#each responsibilities}}
                    <li>{{this}}</li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if resources}}
            <div style="background-color: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #065f46;">📚 Available Resources</h3>
                <ul style="margin: 0; color: #065f46;">
                    {{#each resources}}
                    <li><a href="{{url}}" style="color: #059669; text-decoration: none;">{{name}}</a></li>
                    {{/each}}
                </ul>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div class="important-note">
                <strong>📌 Important:</strong> Please review the assigned students and lab materials before the start date. If you have any questions or concerns about this assignment, contact our support team immediately.
            </div>

            <p>Thank you for your dedication to educating and mentoring the next generation of cloud professionals!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Questions about this assignment? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} {{companyName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
